1
00:00:00,166 --> 00:00:01,431
(This drama complied with production
guidelines for filming child actors,)

2
00:00:01,434 --> 00:00:03,001
(and some scenes used
generative AI technology.)

3
00:00:03,319 --> 00:00:04,939
(Episode 39)

4
00:00:05,112 --> 00:00:06,660
Did you steal my house key card?

5
00:00:07,865 --> 00:00:09,873
What on earth are you doing?

6
00:00:10,255 --> 00:00:11,295
Everyone, get out.

7
00:00:12,192 --> 00:00:13,411
This is mine.

8
00:00:13,578 --> 00:00:14,945
You stole it!

9
00:00:22,899 --> 00:00:24,443
This is trespassing.

10
00:00:24,818 --> 00:00:26,284
I'm reporting all of you!

11
00:00:26,331 --> 00:00:27,786
Go ahead.

12
00:00:27,852 --> 00:00:30,517
But make sure you tell them
what we found in this house.

13
00:00:30,685 --> 00:00:31,761
Tae O!

14
00:00:32,201 --> 00:00:33,412
Didn't I tell you?

15
00:00:33,619 --> 00:00:35,319
I'm not the Na Ji Ni I used to be.

16
00:00:35,912 --> 00:00:38,576
You went through my locker,
stole from me, and wrote insults about me.

17
00:00:39,218 --> 00:00:40,877
This is nothing compared to that.

18
00:00:40,902 --> 00:00:42,246
What you're doing is a crime.

19
00:00:43,045 --> 00:00:45,449
- Like mother, like daughter...
- I told you not to bad-mouth my mom.

20
00:00:46,245 --> 00:00:47,730
Do you think I'll just sit back
and take it?

21
00:00:50,092 --> 00:00:51,161
I still tremble...

22
00:00:52,008 --> 00:00:53,697
when I think about that storage room.

23
00:00:54,612 --> 00:00:57,281
I could kill you and go to prison.

24
00:00:58,084 --> 00:00:59,084
Ji Ni.

25
00:00:59,217 --> 00:01:01,240
Go ahead.

26
00:01:01,536 --> 00:01:03,160
Let's see this through to the end.

27
00:01:13,525 --> 00:01:14,708
Get out!

28
00:01:15,915 --> 00:01:19,323
Get out, you crazy idiots!

29
00:01:20,251 --> 00:01:23,419
I'm sorry. I was wrong.

30
00:01:29,492 --> 00:01:30,988
I'm calling the police.

31
00:01:34,365 --> 00:01:35,452
I'm calling the police.

32
00:01:35,800 --> 00:01:36,800
(Police)

33
00:01:39,099 --> 00:01:40,721
Na Ji Ni!

34
00:01:54,004 --> 00:01:55,753
We've confirmed the evidence,

35
00:01:55,975 --> 00:01:57,631
so I'm going to prove it to CEO Im.

36
00:01:57,956 --> 00:01:58,965
Okay.

37
00:02:00,478 --> 00:02:02,674
It never ends with her.

38
00:02:03,813 --> 00:02:04,986
It's my fault.

39
00:02:05,425 --> 00:02:09,468
It all started because I disobeyed my mom
and invited her to my house.

40
00:02:10,452 --> 00:02:13,803
I saw Do Do Hee getting hit by her mom,

41
00:02:14,176 --> 00:02:15,598
and I felt sorry for her.

42
00:02:15,623 --> 00:02:17,284
Was she hit? By her mom?

43
00:02:17,911 --> 00:02:19,714
She was only in middle school then.

44
00:02:20,745 --> 00:02:22,365
That makes it even more heartbreaking.

45
00:02:22,801 --> 00:02:24,065
No wonder she went down the wrong path.

46
00:02:24,170 --> 00:02:25,864
Even judging by what Ji Hu said,

47
00:02:26,079 --> 00:02:28,593
Do Hee seems most afraid of her mom.

48
00:02:29,044 --> 00:02:30,392
Do you think Ji Ni will really get fired?

49
00:02:30,417 --> 00:02:33,120
I'll never agree to this.
I can't work with Do Hee.

50
00:02:33,647 --> 00:02:35,067
Who told you that?

51
00:02:35,497 --> 00:02:36,497
Ji Hu?

52
00:02:36,732 --> 00:02:39,971
He feels really bad
about what happened to you too.

53
00:02:41,068 --> 00:02:42,216
Forget it.

54
00:02:44,278 --> 00:02:46,119
I guess he's a mama's boy too.

55
00:02:47,172 --> 00:02:49,128
Do Hee's dad is pretty powerful.

56
00:03:04,871 --> 00:03:06,168
Why?

57
00:03:08,211 --> 00:03:09,757
I just wanted some water.

58
00:03:15,585 --> 00:03:16,585
I...

59
00:03:17,513 --> 00:03:20,578
had a nice time today. Thanks.

60
00:03:23,887 --> 00:03:26,426
Is it uncomfortable staying here?

61
00:03:27,294 --> 00:03:28,542
No.

62
00:03:29,465 --> 00:03:32,112
I'm sorry I've imposed on you for so long.

63
00:03:33,339 --> 00:03:35,195
The more I see you,
you really turned out well.

64
00:03:35,438 --> 00:03:38,319
You must've had more rough patches
than most kids.

65
00:03:38,569 --> 00:03:39,569
Well...

66
00:03:40,091 --> 00:03:41,917
It's the same here.

67
00:03:43,078 --> 00:03:46,719
The adults are to blame for what
you and my kids went through.

68
00:03:50,712 --> 00:03:53,170
That's because of you.

69
00:03:53,172 --> 00:03:54,172
I...

70
00:03:54,536 --> 00:03:58,402
We did our best to keep the kids
from getting hurt.

71
00:04:00,911 --> 00:04:01,911
Mom!

72
00:04:08,772 --> 00:04:10,332
I don't understand your logic.

73
00:04:10,357 --> 00:04:11,737
I can't agree with you, either.

74
00:04:11,834 --> 00:04:14,513
Who caused all this?
Why blame someone else?

75
00:04:14,621 --> 00:04:15,621
Na Ji Ni!

76
00:04:15,729 --> 00:04:17,982
Yeah, I'm Na Ji Ni.

77
00:04:18,804 --> 00:04:21,575
But wrong is still wrong.

78
00:04:21,600 --> 00:04:23,647
Please don't twist everything around.

79
00:04:23,998 --> 00:04:25,974
You're ashamed of me too, right?

80
00:04:26,478 --> 00:04:28,080
You hate that I'm your mom, right?

81
00:04:28,233 --> 00:04:31,532
You'd be proud
if Yeong Ju were your mom, right?

82
00:04:31,557 --> 00:04:33,899
Mom, please don't jump to conclusions.

83
00:04:34,331 --> 00:04:35,735
That's not what I'm saying.

84
00:04:35,760 --> 00:04:38,948
Who do you think I'm holding on for?

85
00:04:38,979 --> 00:04:40,813
If you're not on my side too,

86
00:04:40,844 --> 00:04:43,754
then who am I supposed to turn to?

87
00:04:48,311 --> 00:04:49,401
Mom.

88
00:04:49,917 --> 00:04:52,440
She told me I turned out well.

89
00:04:52,465 --> 00:04:54,754
That I turned out well
despite everything I went through.

90
00:04:56,599 --> 00:04:57,899
So I told her...

91
00:04:57,924 --> 00:05:00,518
everyone here must've had a hard time too.

92
00:05:00,912 --> 00:05:05,121
But you blamed all of that on her.

93
00:05:05,273 --> 00:05:06,767
What was I supposed to say?

94
00:05:06,792 --> 00:05:10,726
Was I supposed to blame her
for not doing the paperwork sooner?

95
00:05:11,050 --> 00:05:12,104
Why not?

96
00:05:14,066 --> 00:05:15,066
Mom, I...

97
00:05:16,032 --> 00:05:18,906
can't do that. That's not right.

98
00:05:18,931 --> 00:05:21,873
If you love me
but still have to think logically,

99
00:05:21,898 --> 00:05:23,319
then you don't love me.

100
00:05:26,085 --> 00:05:29,394
Mom, you're only acting like this
because of dad.

101
00:05:29,419 --> 00:05:31,464
He lets you get away with everything,
so you never grew up.

102
00:05:31,489 --> 00:05:33,644
That's why you should be on my side.

103
00:05:33,669 --> 00:05:35,407
Who else do I have?

104
00:05:35,432 --> 00:05:38,155
Yeong Ju has two sons who provide for her,

105
00:05:38,179 --> 00:05:41,500
and now she's even dating.
She has everything.

106
00:05:41,517 --> 00:05:43,245
And you're taking her side too?

107
00:05:44,645 --> 00:05:48,095
This makes no sense. Stop it, Mom.

108
00:05:48,831 --> 00:05:52,393
- What's gotten into you?
- I don't know. Maybe it's menopause!

109
00:05:52,773 --> 00:05:54,067
Just leave me alone.

110
00:05:54,349 --> 00:05:56,833
I put up with you
when you were a teenager,

111
00:05:56,857 --> 00:05:59,384
so cut me some slack, okay?

112
00:06:01,162 --> 00:06:02,162
Seriously!

113
00:06:23,731 --> 00:06:26,263
Why are you out here?

114
00:06:27,858 --> 00:06:30,779
Seung Hyun's already asleep.

115
00:06:33,494 --> 00:06:36,484
I feel bloated or something.
I can't get comfortable.

116
00:06:38,218 --> 00:06:39,684
I want to go to a club.

117
00:06:42,397 --> 00:06:43,752
Me too.

118
00:06:44,768 --> 00:06:45,839
Should we go?

119
00:06:46,069 --> 00:06:47,069
Want to...

120
00:06:47,763 --> 00:06:50,916
- blow off some steam?
- Seriously? Right now?

121
00:06:51,424 --> 00:06:52,424
Don't you want to?

122
00:06:53,146 --> 00:06:54,489
Honestly, I'm tired.

123
00:06:55,051 --> 00:06:57,753
It's been ages
since I've been to a club too.

124
00:07:00,045 --> 00:07:01,045
Then...

125
00:07:01,545 --> 00:07:03,217
let's do something fun.

126
00:07:10,032 --> 00:07:12,496
Hey, don't use spit on it.

127
00:07:12,745 --> 00:07:14,955
Just worry about yourself.

128
00:07:14,980 --> 00:07:17,599
I'm doing it.

129
00:07:17,623 --> 00:07:20,712
Look!

130
00:07:22,611 --> 00:07:24,439
Keep it down!

131
00:07:24,464 --> 00:07:27,316
Ten seconds left. Nine, eight, seven, six!

132
00:07:29,916 --> 00:07:31,288
You distracted me!

133
00:07:31,647 --> 00:07:33,143
Hey, it's still good even if it breaks.

134
00:07:35,914 --> 00:07:38,287
Hey, dalgona.

135
00:07:56,045 --> 00:07:57,633
Honey.

136
00:07:58,922 --> 00:08:00,472
I miss you.

137
00:08:02,186 --> 00:08:03,342
I miss you.

138
00:08:05,458 --> 00:08:07,706
Honey, I miss you!

139
00:08:08,691 --> 00:08:09,938
My mother-in-law...

140
00:08:10,595 --> 00:08:12,442
never seems to miss him.

141
00:08:17,578 --> 00:08:20,078
I miss my dear O Reum too.

142
00:08:23,725 --> 00:08:25,991
I miss O Reum.

143
00:08:38,638 --> 00:08:40,254
I miss him.

144
00:08:44,218 --> 00:08:47,291
I miss you, honey.

145
00:09:04,765 --> 00:09:05,868
Ji Hu.

146
00:09:10,184 --> 00:09:11,566
I heard from Tae O.

147
00:09:12,432 --> 00:09:15,071
What are they saying now?
You're going to take their side again.

148
00:09:15,591 --> 00:09:19,444
- No. I came to hear your side too.
- What is there to say?

149
00:09:19,469 --> 00:09:20,966
Just look at this.
Does this make any sense?

150
00:09:21,312 --> 00:09:23,321
They barged into someone else's house
and did all this.

151
00:09:23,592 --> 00:09:25,225
They came with Tae O and did this?

152
00:09:25,250 --> 00:09:26,261
Why didn't you report it?

153
00:09:26,592 --> 00:09:27,592
Because...

154
00:09:28,303 --> 00:09:30,414
- I didn't want to embarrass my dad...
- No.

155
00:09:31,086 --> 00:09:35,104
It's because you started this by stealing
Ji Ni's tablet, isn't it?

156
00:09:35,129 --> 00:09:37,887
Even so, they went too far.
Don't you think?

157
00:09:38,398 --> 00:09:39,532
Don't you?

158
00:09:45,171 --> 00:09:46,284
Let's break up.

159
00:09:48,347 --> 00:09:49,347
Ji Hu.

160
00:09:50,503 --> 00:09:51,543
I've made up my mind.

161
00:09:52,411 --> 00:09:54,372
- I can't do this.
- No!

162
00:09:54,859 --> 00:09:57,711
I can't marry you
or stay with you anymore.

163
00:09:57,736 --> 00:09:59,684
Why? What's wrong with me?

164
00:09:59,709 --> 00:10:01,899
The way you deal with problems
is so different from mine.

165
00:10:01,924 --> 00:10:03,280
That's the difference between us.

166
00:10:04,845 --> 00:10:05,845
Do Hee,

167
00:10:06,139 --> 00:10:07,935
you need to step
out of your parents' shadow.

168
00:10:08,372 --> 00:10:09,610
Otherwise...

169
00:10:10,619 --> 00:10:12,591
you'll spend the rest
of your life like this.

170
00:10:16,358 --> 00:10:17,857
I love you, Ji Hu.

171
00:10:18,758 --> 00:10:20,058
I don't want to break up.

172
00:10:20,165 --> 00:10:21,821
I want you to acknowledge me.

173
00:10:27,432 --> 00:10:29,424
And stop talking about Ji Ni's parents.

174
00:10:29,449 --> 00:10:32,209
- Ji Hu, but...
- Ji Ni's independent of her parents.

175
00:10:32,212 --> 00:10:33,440
You should be too.

176
00:10:34,759 --> 00:10:36,672
We're too old to be talking
about our parents.

177
00:10:37,039 --> 00:10:39,348
How can you not talk
about where you come from?

178
00:10:39,991 --> 00:10:41,666
It's something that follows you for life.

179
00:10:42,491 --> 00:10:43,730
Anyway, enough.

180
00:10:44,952 --> 00:10:46,918
I just made it clear
that I want to break up.

181
00:10:47,172 --> 00:10:48,333
Don't ignore what I said.

182
00:10:49,079 --> 00:10:50,079
We're over.

183
00:10:52,998 --> 00:10:53,998
Ji Hu.

184
00:10:55,177 --> 00:10:56,177
Ji Hu!

185
00:11:18,677 --> 00:11:19,928
What do you think?

186
00:11:23,275 --> 00:11:24,622
They're similar, but...

187
00:11:25,142 --> 00:11:28,202
I don't think this is enough to prove
my daughter-in-law...

188
00:11:28,219 --> 00:11:29,791
copied your work.

189
00:11:30,407 --> 00:11:33,775
Plagiarism is absolutely unacceptable.

190
00:11:33,800 --> 00:11:37,067
Strictly speaking, the drawings
on your tablet are mine.

191
00:11:37,092 --> 00:11:40,366
I paid you
and asked you to start working on them.

192
00:11:40,479 --> 00:11:41,599
Sir.

193
00:11:41,624 --> 00:11:42,624
On the other hand,

194
00:11:43,178 --> 00:11:45,862
you broke into Do Hee's house last night.

195
00:11:46,152 --> 00:11:48,009
Isn't that a much bigger crime?

196
00:11:50,052 --> 00:11:53,625
So I was supposed to just stand by
after my work was stolen?

197
00:11:54,959 --> 00:11:56,674
Let's end things here.

198
00:11:57,732 --> 00:12:01,559
I even asked you to be careful
because I saw Do Hee as my future in-law.

199
00:12:03,371 --> 00:12:05,706
Creating a problem this big puts me
in a difficult position too.

200
00:12:07,212 --> 00:12:09,324
So I'm not being fired for my work,

201
00:12:10,138 --> 00:12:11,611
but because of connections?

202
00:12:11,636 --> 00:12:13,573
Hiring and firing are my decisions.

203
00:12:15,206 --> 00:12:18,222
- That's wrongful termination.
- Let me give you some fatherly advice.

204
00:12:18,643 --> 00:12:20,892
Life will be difficult for you
if you keep going this way.

205
00:12:20,923 --> 00:12:22,169
I'm the CEO.

206
00:12:22,193 --> 00:12:25,401
If you keep targeting my family, doesn't
that mean you don't want to work with me?

207
00:12:28,837 --> 00:12:29,992
I understand.

208
00:12:31,367 --> 00:12:32,489
Dad.

209
00:12:34,319 --> 00:12:37,172
- Why did you come all the way here?
- Because it's unfair.

210
00:12:37,405 --> 00:12:39,602
Ji Ni is the victim.
You're the one who misunderstood.

211
00:12:39,627 --> 00:12:41,644
Misunderstood or not, I have one rule.

212
00:12:42,098 --> 00:12:43,650
I protect my own people.

213
00:12:45,625 --> 00:12:47,027
Don't give up, Ji Ni.

214
00:12:47,065 --> 00:12:48,871
This fairy tale book is your work.

215
00:12:48,896 --> 00:12:49,896
Ji Hu!

216
00:12:51,071 --> 00:12:52,228
We broke up.

217
00:12:52,672 --> 00:12:55,019
You don't have to worry
about Ambassador Do anymore.

218
00:12:55,043 --> 00:12:56,043
You really...

219
00:13:00,132 --> 00:13:01,521
What do you think you're doing?

220
00:13:01,675 --> 00:13:03,410
I don't live the way you do, Dad.

221
00:13:03,825 --> 00:13:06,647
I was taught
that being family doesn't justify...

222
00:13:07,184 --> 00:13:08,698
treating others unfairly.

223
00:13:10,593 --> 00:13:13,600
Dad, please. Think about it one more time.

224
00:13:13,752 --> 00:13:15,785
Now I understand why Do Hee
says you're making things difficult.

225
00:13:16,397 --> 00:13:19,008
You can't protect your family
by acting like this.

226
00:13:27,164 --> 00:13:30,041
Hey, you got fired, didn't you?

227
00:13:30,315 --> 00:13:32,027
My talent isn't going anywhere.

228
00:13:32,052 --> 00:13:33,185
You can't draw.

229
00:13:33,577 --> 00:13:34,814
Seriously.

230
00:13:35,558 --> 00:13:38,699
The harder you try to push me down,
the stronger I get.

231
00:13:39,490 --> 00:13:40,766
Do whatever you want.

232
00:13:41,112 --> 00:13:43,478
What started in that storage room
won't end until someone dies.

233
00:13:44,617 --> 00:13:45,617
"Storage room?"

234
00:13:49,046 --> 00:13:50,821
Our fun little storage room.

235
00:13:55,878 --> 00:13:58,330
Your dad isn't here to save you anymore.

236
00:14:13,672 --> 00:14:15,968
Ji Ni, I want to apologize.

237
00:14:16,492 --> 00:14:18,578
Let's meet in the empty lot
behind the school.

238
00:14:19,298 --> 00:14:21,563
It's too embarrassing to do it
in the classroom.

239
00:14:22,444 --> 00:14:23,867
You'll wait for me, right?

240
00:14:24,861 --> 00:14:27,034
You really came.

241
00:14:32,892 --> 00:14:34,370
Don't be afraid.

242
00:14:38,041 --> 00:14:39,707
Makes us look like the bad guys.

243
00:14:49,583 --> 00:14:52,026
Ji Ni!

244
00:14:54,916 --> 00:14:56,026
Ji Ni.

245
00:14:57,583 --> 00:14:58,583
Ji Ni.

246
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:02,073
Ji Ni.

247
00:15:05,500 --> 00:15:06,500
Ji Ni.

248
00:15:08,886 --> 00:15:09,886
Ji Ni.

249
00:15:10,701 --> 00:15:11,701
Ji Ni.

250
00:15:15,750 --> 00:15:16,750
Ji Ni.

251
00:15:21,208 --> 00:15:25,921
Ji Ni.

252
00:15:45,041 --> 00:15:46,791
(Na Ji Ni, Illegitimate Child)

253
00:15:50,125 --> 00:15:51,416
(Illegitimate Child)

254
00:15:59,666 --> 00:16:02,541
(Die, mistress's daughter, Na Ji Ni.)

255
00:16:14,599 --> 00:16:16,599
(No mistress's daughter in our class.
Disgusting, Na Ji Ni.)

256
00:16:16,602 --> 00:16:18,602
(Na Ji Ni, go die.)

257
00:16:20,916 --> 00:16:24,061
Let me go. You said you'd apologize.

258
00:16:25,250 --> 00:16:27,583
I have nothing to apologize for.

259
00:16:28,166 --> 00:16:29,567
You're a mistress's daughter.

260
00:16:29,833 --> 00:16:31,558
That's not a lie.

261
00:16:31,833 --> 00:16:32,873
Hey, I'll take your picture.

262
00:16:32,875 --> 00:16:35,958
Hey, look at me. Let me see your face.

263
00:16:36,208 --> 00:16:38,791
Hey, let me see your face.

264
00:16:39,166 --> 00:16:41,916
Hey, they say you're
the prettiest girl at school.

265
00:16:42,083 --> 00:16:43,623
Why'd you call me?

266
00:16:43,625 --> 00:16:46,164
- Hey, do we look good together?
- Yeah, you do.

267
00:16:46,166 --> 00:16:47,402
Move.

268
00:16:51,375 --> 00:16:53,539
- Seriously!
- Hey, stay still.

269
00:16:53,541 --> 00:16:54,541
Hey.

270
00:16:55,083 --> 00:16:56,791
That's enough.

271
00:16:57,833 --> 00:16:59,743
Why are you doing this to me?

272
00:17:02,208 --> 00:17:03,633
Save me!

273
00:17:06,125 --> 00:17:07,885
I never said I'd kill you.

274
00:17:10,672 --> 00:17:13,381
Drop out of school. Quit the art club.

275
00:17:15,416 --> 00:17:16,873
She's got some attitude.

276
00:17:16,875 --> 00:17:17,875
She won't give up.

277
00:17:18,458 --> 00:17:20,168
Then we have to stop her from drawing.

278
00:17:20,575 --> 00:17:22,245
Make sure she can never
show her face again.

279
00:17:22,916 --> 00:17:23,927
Destroy her.

280
00:17:27,541 --> 00:17:28,998
Hey, take the picture.

281
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:31,480
Hey, you two look good together.

282
00:17:33,041 --> 00:17:34,330
What?

283
00:17:35,500 --> 00:17:37,625
Save me!

284
00:17:38,159 --> 00:17:39,159
Ji Ni.

285
00:17:41,458 --> 00:17:42,866
You little punks!

286
00:17:51,291 --> 00:17:53,636
Ji Ni!

287
00:17:55,416 --> 00:17:59,208
Ji Ni.

288
00:17:59,562 --> 00:18:02,900
I'm sorry. I don't know how to face you.

289
00:18:27,958 --> 00:18:28,958
Ji Ni.

290
00:18:30,916 --> 00:18:31,916
It's me.

291
00:18:32,958 --> 00:18:35,664
Yes? What is it?

292
00:18:35,666 --> 00:18:36,666
I'm sorry.

293
00:18:38,826 --> 00:18:39,883
Forget it.

294
00:18:40,375 --> 00:18:41,897
I'm tired of hearing that.

295
00:18:42,083 --> 00:18:44,141
- I just...
- You pity me?

296
00:18:44,750 --> 00:18:46,849
You feel bad for me,
but can't do anything to help?

297
00:18:47,166 --> 00:18:49,711
Enough. Please just leave me alone.

298
00:18:51,820 --> 00:18:54,702
I don't know why I keep
getting involved with you like this.

299
00:18:55,416 --> 00:18:58,177
Do Do Hee, the CEO, and you.

300
00:18:59,083 --> 00:19:00,556
You're all the same to me.

301
00:19:22,083 --> 00:19:23,083
Ji Ni.

302
00:19:26,458 --> 00:19:27,549
Thank you.

303
00:19:28,350 --> 00:19:29,736
I don't know what to say.

304
00:19:30,399 --> 00:19:32,330
Okay. Let's look for somewhere else.

305
00:19:32,333 --> 00:19:33,843
Are you leaving too?

306
00:19:34,416 --> 00:19:36,500
No. I'm the only one who needs to go.

307
00:19:36,541 --> 00:19:39,331
How can I work with Do Hee without you?
I can't.

308
00:19:39,333 --> 00:19:40,977
But not right now.

309
00:19:41,958 --> 00:19:43,448
I feel uncomfortable.

310
00:19:46,416 --> 00:19:48,142
I'll try to get through this.

311
00:20:26,791 --> 00:20:28,682
- A proposal?
- Yes.

312
00:20:29,125 --> 00:20:33,333
Yeong Ju likes me too. I'm sure of it now.

313
00:20:33,693 --> 00:20:34,998
Then I should propose.

314
00:20:35,000 --> 00:20:37,598
We met too late. We don't have much time.

315
00:20:39,583 --> 00:20:42,431
Does she like you too?

316
00:20:45,966 --> 00:20:49,086
She's getting remarried
even though the kids are against it?

317
00:20:52,263 --> 00:20:54,956
So I wanted to ask you for a favor.
Please help me.

318
00:20:55,314 --> 00:20:57,160
You're living with the kids, after all.

319
00:20:57,916 --> 00:20:59,349
What can I do?

320
00:20:59,352 --> 00:21:01,039
Tell them that their mom might be lonely,

321
00:21:01,041 --> 00:21:02,873
and that being a mom or grandma
isn't what's important.

322
00:21:03,105 --> 00:21:04,379
Please try to convince them.

323
00:21:09,479 --> 00:21:11,120
You want me to plan a proposal?

324
00:21:12,377 --> 00:21:13,910
You're an art planner.

325
00:21:14,458 --> 00:21:16,658
Of course, I'll pay you.

326
00:21:16,872 --> 00:21:19,577
I want to do it at the Cine Mall
where Joong Bin works.

327
00:21:20,041 --> 00:21:23,398
Make it something spectacular and magical.

328
00:21:25,456 --> 00:21:26,533
Hold on.

329
00:21:27,784 --> 00:21:29,882
Love you. I'm counting on you.

330
00:21:33,750 --> 00:21:35,140
You know I love you, right?

331
00:21:36,791 --> 00:21:37,791
I love you.

332
00:21:47,196 --> 00:21:49,206
I bought this because I thought of you.

333
00:21:50,083 --> 00:21:51,576
I love it.

334
00:21:51,833 --> 00:21:53,716
I was just craving some.

335
00:21:54,040 --> 00:21:55,099
That's a relief.

336
00:21:56,000 --> 00:21:58,447
I heard you should eat plenty
before the morning sickness starts.

337
00:21:59,166 --> 00:22:00,166
Then I'll dig in.

338
00:22:03,416 --> 00:22:05,250
It's delicious.

339
00:22:05,791 --> 00:22:08,208
I was just about to text Seung Hyun
to get some for me.

340
00:22:08,295 --> 00:22:09,410
Guess I don't have to now.

341
00:22:12,120 --> 00:22:13,590
Have some of this too.

342
00:22:15,781 --> 00:22:17,531
But is something wrong?

343
00:22:19,005 --> 00:22:22,371
I just needed a little encouragement.

344
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:24,820
It's one of those days
when you need a boost.

345
00:22:31,955 --> 00:22:32,955
What's wrong?

346
00:22:35,083 --> 00:22:36,289
What's wrong?

347
00:22:36,291 --> 00:22:37,291
Wait...

348
00:22:41,083 --> 00:22:42,385
Mai.

349
00:22:43,949 --> 00:22:47,373
- Are you okay?
- I need to go to the hospital.

350
00:22:47,375 --> 00:22:49,206
Okay, hold on to me.

351
00:22:49,208 --> 00:22:50,916
What should we do?

352
00:23:16,132 --> 00:23:18,750
(Haemyeong University Hospital)

353
00:23:18,875 --> 00:23:21,147
For now, the best thing
is to let her rest.

354
00:23:21,708 --> 00:23:23,250
She's also showing signs of depression.

355
00:23:23,253 --> 00:23:25,653
Please help her focus
on recovering her health.

356
00:23:26,589 --> 00:23:28,747
Yes, I understand.

357
00:23:34,791 --> 00:23:37,575
Don't worry. She'll be okay.

358
00:23:38,507 --> 00:23:40,835
She's always been such a cheerful girl.

359
00:23:41,875 --> 00:23:42,875
Go home.

360
00:23:43,458 --> 00:23:44,458
Okay.

361
00:24:01,625 --> 00:24:02,625
Father.

362
00:24:04,458 --> 00:24:05,778
Our dear Seung Hyun...

363
00:24:06,547 --> 00:24:08,842
has already been through so much.

364
00:24:10,958 --> 00:24:12,817
But I was so caught up in my own pain...

365
00:24:13,534 --> 00:24:16,298
that I couldn't even properly embrace him.

366
00:24:19,375 --> 00:24:21,014
Please help us.

367
00:24:48,625 --> 00:24:49,812
I'm sorry.

368
00:24:51,041 --> 00:24:52,485
I'm okay.

369
00:24:54,083 --> 00:24:56,362
This baby was already on the way
when we lost O Reum.

370
00:24:57,666 --> 00:25:00,263
I couldn't even bring myself
to be happy about it.

371
00:25:01,625 --> 00:25:05,639
Maybe the baby knew how I felt
and left me.

372
00:25:07,375 --> 00:25:08,375
Mai.

373
00:25:13,000 --> 00:25:16,887
I want to rest, Seung Hyun.
I want to sleep.

374
00:25:19,041 --> 00:25:20,041
Okay.

375
00:25:21,333 --> 00:25:24,750
- Is the temperature okay?
- Yeah.

376
00:26:26,583 --> 00:26:27,683
Seung Woo.

377
00:26:28,083 --> 00:26:30,555
What are we going to do
about your poor brother?

378
00:26:37,395 --> 00:26:39,116
Mom, you can't do this.

379
00:27:10,500 --> 00:27:13,789
(Family Register)

380
00:27:13,791 --> 00:27:15,125
Is everything going well?

381
00:27:15,166 --> 00:27:17,916
Sa Bin's going to propose.
Will you say yes?

382
00:27:17,958 --> 00:27:19,458
Find out who Sa Bin's seeing.

383
00:27:19,500 --> 00:27:20,581
Her appearance...

384
00:27:20,583 --> 00:27:22,333
Did you really steal her work?

385
00:27:22,375 --> 00:27:23,958
- No.
- Enough.

386
00:27:24,000 --> 00:27:25,081
That doesn't matter to me.

387
00:27:25,083 --> 00:27:27,581
Your dad and I won't give up on Do Hee.
Get that through your head.

388
00:27:27,583 --> 00:27:29,914
- You got fired?
- She's getting kicked out, just like you.

389
00:27:29,916 --> 00:27:33,164
Just a hundred years ago, we couldn't
even speak to a mistress like this.

390
00:27:33,166 --> 00:27:36,083
How long do I have to keep talking
about what happened 30 years ago?

391
00:27:36,125 --> 00:27:37,581
It's not Mai's fault.
You know that, right?

392
00:27:37,583 --> 00:27:39,500
- Where's Mai?
- O Reum.

393
00:27:39,503 --> 00:27:42,369
I can't come for a while.

394
00:27:42,583 --> 00:27:44,673
I love you very much.

395
00:27:45,202 --> 00:27:47,202
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
